          "Engage the college or university anchor explicitly: the 37.3% college attainment and 22-year median age suggest an educational institution is the economic and demographic foundation of the district; higher education funding, tuition affordability, and the workforce pipeline from education into New Hampshire employment are concrete policy levers that directly affect constituent quality of life.",
