          "Engage the 41.3% renter constituency specifically on housing affordability and cost-of-living pressure — this is the swing demographic within the district most vulnerable to Republican economic messaging, and it requires affirmative Democratic engagement around real housing constraints, not assumptions of Democratic loyalty.",
