          "Engage renters specifically on housing supply and zoning: the 25.3% renter minority is persuadable if candidates demonstrate how development and zoning reform reduce scarcity-driven rent escalation rather than enabling gentrification; supply-side housing policy is the Republicans' most credible opening with this group.",
          "Avoid ideological or identity-based messaging; this constituency expects policy substance and competence evaluation — candidates who lead with grievance rather than governance or who assume partisan loyalty is sufficient will be punished by an educated, skeptical electorate that votes on merit."
