          "Identify the specific local issues driving Democratic consolidation in an affluent district: education funding and school quality, property tax management, local infrastructure investment, and professional-services economy support are the concrete governance concerns of $119k households — understand whether the 67% reflects performance on these issues or broader national sentiment that could prove fragile.",
