          "Recognize that 82.69% white demographics can obscure 9.88% Asian, Black, and Hispanic communities: the Asian professional cohort in healthcare and technical fields deserves specific engagement; Black and Hispanic constituents deserve to be visible in the district narrative rather than absorbed into an Anglo-majority coalition story."
